  "messageType": "223",
  "name": "Consolidators Freight Bill and Invoice",
  "description": "This Draft Standard for Trial Use contains the format and establishes the data contents of the Consolidators Freight Bill and Invoice Transaction Set (223) for use within the context of an Electronic Data Interchange (EDI) environment.\nThe transaction set can be used by a freight consolidator to transmit invoice and freight bill data to the appropriate party. The freight bill services may be provided by the consolidator or a motor carrier unrelated to the consolidator. This transaction shall not be used to transmit freight bill data without consolidator's invoice data.",
